# Bloodthorn Flail: the equip cost is one of two ways, chosen as it is activated (CR 702.6a, 601.2b by way of 602.2b). On
# turn 1 Bot1 has an empty hand and only two mana floating (Pearl and a Swamp), so neither way can be paid and the equip is
# not offered. On turn 3 Bot1's drawn Swamp - a land, so any card will do - is a card to discard: with its untapped Moxen
# and Swamp it could pay {3} instead, but it equips by discarding the Swamp, pays no mana (its pool stays empty and no
# payment is asked), and the Trader (1/1) becomes 3/2 - only the equipped creature: Bot1's Ornithopter stays 0/2.

[Bot1 Deck]
Bloodthorn Flail
Dwarven Trader
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Swamp
Ornithopter
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

